{"path":"memory/memory_resource/do_deallocate","title":"std::pmr::memory_resource::do_deallocate","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::pmr::memory_resource::</span>do_deallocate","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/memory/memory_resource/do_deallocate","section":"memory","kind":"page","summary":"Deallocates the storage pointed to by p.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx17\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">virtual</span> <span class=\"kw4\">void</span> do_deallocate<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">void</span><span class=\"sy2\">*</span> p, <a href=\"/w/cpp/types/size_t\"><span class=\"kw107\">std::<span class=\"me2\">size_t</span></span></a> bytes, <a href=\"/w/cpp/types/size_t\"><span class=\"kw107\">std::<span class=\"me2\">size_t</span></span></a> alignment <span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"nu0\">0</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx17\">(since C++17)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Deallocates the storage pointed to by <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">p</span></code>.\n</p><p><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">p</span></code> must have been returned by a prior call to <code>allocate(bytes, alignment)</code> on a <code>memory_resource</code> that compares equal to <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code>, and the storage it points to must not yet have been deallocated, otherwise the behavior is undefined.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Exceptions\">Exceptions </h3>\n<p>Throws nothing.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also </h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/memory/memory_resource/deallocate\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>deallocate</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  deallocates memory <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Exceptions","id":"Exceptions"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"memory","title":"Memory management library"},{"path":"memory/memory_resource","title":"std::pmr::memory_resource"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::pmr::memory_resource::do_deallocate","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: since C++17. Deallocates the storage pointed to by p."},{"label":"Exceptions","note":"Throws nothing."},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"deallocate","note":"deallocates memory"}]}]},"standards":["C++17"],"wordCount":69,"codeBlockCount":0}
